<!-- INTRO -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px 64px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="intro-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div style="position:relative;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 56px rgba(10,61,92,0.22);aspect-ratio:1/1;">
        <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="Post-war brick and fibro houses on a quiet Geelong street" width="1024" height="1024" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div style="position:absolute;bottom:-18px;right:-14px;background:#2FA34D;color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(47,163,77,0.4);">
        <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin:0;line-height:1;">Free</p>
        <p style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin:4px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">Quotes</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Geelong and the Barwon region</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 18px;">Get it tested before you touch it</h2>
      <div class="rich"><p>Barwon Asbestos Co covers asbestos testing, removal and disposal for homeowners across Geelong and the Barwon region. Most enquiries are one of four things: a fibro fence that is falling apart, a garage or Super Six roof that has been damaged, sheeting found part way through a renovation, or a building and pest inspection that has flagged asbestos before a sale. The first job is always the same, which is to find out what the material actually is. <a href="/asbestos-testing-geelong/">Testing</a> costs $88 to $160 per sample, and a standard house needs three to eight samples, because a fence, an eaves lining and a bathroom wall sheet are three separate materials.</p><p>We are not a licensed removalist and we do not claim to be. Removal is carried out by licensed asbestos removalists we work with, their WorkSafe Victoria licence number appears on every quote, and you contract with them directly. Whatever comes after the removal, a new fence or a new roof, is separate building work you take up with a registered builder. What this site does is point you at the right service, whether that is <a href="/asbestos-fence-removal-geelong/">fence removal</a>, <a href="/asbestos-roof-removal-geelong/">roof and shed removal</a> or <a href="/asbestos-disposal-geelong/">disposal</a>, and show you the <a href="/asbestos-removal-cost/">price ranges</a> before you pick up the phone.</p></div>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-blue" style="margin-top:10px;">More About Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: 44px !important; } }
</style>

