        <img src="/images/service-2.webp" alt="Corrugated fibre cement roof sheeting on a suburban garage, weathered and moss spotted" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
