        <img src="/images/tile-1.webp" alt="Cracked and weathered fibre cement sheeting on an exterior house wall" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;padding:14px 12px;">Sheeting found mid renovation</span>
      </a>
