<!-- WHY -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="why-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">What Makes Us Different</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 28px;">Straight answers first, licensed removalists second</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Testing before anything else</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">A sample analysed by a NATA accredited laboratory costs $88 to $160 and comes back in 1 to 5 business days. A negative result means you get on with the job, and it is the cheapest way to settle the question.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">The licence number is on the quote</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Removal is carried out by licensed asbestos removalists we work with, and their WorkSafe Victoria licence number appears on every quote. We hold no removal licence ourselves and we never quote on their behalf.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Real price ranges, published up front</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">A whole fibro fence is $1,000 to $3,500 and a house roof $4,000 to $15,000 in published Victorian rates. Those are Melbourne metro benchmarks rather than Geelong quotes, because no Geelong rate is published anywhere.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
