<!-- PROCESS -->
<section style="padding:76px 24px;background:#EAF5FB;">
  <div style="max-width:1020px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">How It Works</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin:0 0 44px;">Three Steps, Starting With a Test.</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#2FA34D;color:#fff;font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Call and describe it</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Tell us what the material is, where it sits, roughly how much of it there is, and whether anything has already been broken or disturbed. That is usually enough to work out whether your first step is a lab test or a removal quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#2FA34D;color:#fff;font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Test it, or get it looked at</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">If the material has never been identified, a sample goes to a NATA accredited laboratory and you get a written result in 1 to 5 business days. If it is plainly a removal job, a licensed removalist inspects the material on site and sets the scope.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#2FA34D;color:#fff;font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">A written quote, in their name</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">The removalist gives you a written quote carrying their own WorkSafe Victoria licence number, and you engage them directly. We are not a party to that contract and we do not price the work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
